Bind Npc 14424 Zone 12
Quest 353 "Past Mistake"
    Journal "Put the Dark Stone who lost control to sleep!"
    Kill 80 of 2403, 2453 at direction_173

Requires player level >= 81 and player is elmorad

Rewards
    Give 83750000 experience

direction_173 = location "Dark Stone" found "Eslant" at 130 135 in zone 12

On available
    Say "Master, it's said that there's a monster who's gone berserk in Eslant. Please ask [Ascetic] Tabeth for details."
    Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On offer
    Say "Hm~they were no more than rocks. The ancient Priest gave life to them, and employed them as servants. They're Stone Golems. After the war against Pathos, the Priests lost control of them, and they staged an attack agasint anything living."
    Topic "Tell me more..." do
        Show quest "Well, the carelessness of the ancient Priests may have caused the current problem, but everybody makes mistakes. But the power of Dark Stones is the strongest, and they're ruthless. The outcome of one mistake seems too severe..."

On in_progress
    Say "Dark Stone is one of the strongest Stone Golems."
    Topic "Where can I find it?" do
        Map direction_173

On ready
    Say "Dark Stones which lost control, rest in peace... ha~"
    Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On claimable
    Show quest "You're still very good. If we have a way to regain control over them, we won't need to be engaged in tough fights like this..."
